l reranks actual query–passage pairs at a bounded candidate depth; it is neither randomized nor fine-tuned on test data.","metadata":{}},{"id":"section-09-code","cell_type":"code","source":"print(f\"Rerank candidate depth: {SMOKE_CONFIG['retrieval']['rerank_candidate_depth']}\")\nrerank_tables = matching_artifacts(('rerank', 'cross_encoder'))\nfor artifact in rerank_tables:\n    print(f'\\n{artifact.name}: {json.dumps(preview_csv(artifact), indent=2, default=str)}')\nif not rerank_tables:\n    print('No reranking artifact is available yet; unavailable model inference is not converted into synthetic rankings.')\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-23T15:56:27.426863Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-23T15:56:27.427178Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-23T15:56:27.439481Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-10-23T15:56:27.427112Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-23T15:56:27.438574Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Rerank candidate depth: 10\n\nreranking_improvements.csv: []\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":10},{"id":"section-10-markdown","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 10 — Retrieval evaluation and metric unit tests\n\nThe benchmark computes Recall@1/5/10, MRR@10, nDCG@10, MAP@10, and Precision@10 from official qrels. Rankings are deduplicated at the parent-document level, queries with no positive qrel are reported explicitly, and a hand-checked deterministic metric test runs below before results are trusted.","metadata":{}},{"id":"section-10-code","cell_type":"code","source":"from rag_benchmark.metrics import map_at_k, mrr_at_k, ndcg_at_k, precision_at_k, recall_at_k\n\ndef metric_unit_test():\n    ranking = ['miss', 'd1', 'd2']\n    qrels = {'d1': 1, 'd2': 1}\n    observed = {\n        'recall_at_1': recall_at_k(ranking, qrels, 1),\n        'recall_at_3': recall_at_k(ranking, qrels, 3),\n        'mrr_at_3': mrr_at_k(ranking, qrels, 3),\n        'precision_at_3': precision_at_k(ranking, qrels, 3),\n        'map_at